title: "NexusMind: A Local-First Agentic RAG Engine"
abstract: >-
  Local-first Agentic RAG engine combining GraphRAG, hybrid retrieval
  (BM25 + dense + RRF + rerank), multi-agent orchestration and MCP-native
  tooling with 100% local inference via Ollama.
